WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.280
Good morning, Rachel.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.940
Morning...

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.900
I wonder if Mana's awake?

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.570
She was up late last night doing student council paperwork,

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.550
so let's meet up with her early.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.500
Rikka, you'd be a great wife for Mana!

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.440
Do you even know what that means?

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.640
Oh?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.240
You, as my wife?

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.040
I know, what a hoot!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.880
No, I can see it!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.520
A wife is always by your side,

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.320
and you trust her more than anyone!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.840
That's totally you!

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.050
I second that!

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.790
What are you two on about?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:50.500
So, today,

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.200
our class will be welcoming a new student.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:55.930
A transfer?

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.020
Boy or girl?

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.400
My heart's pounding!

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.670
Who could it be?

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:03.570
I'm sure you kids know her well.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.870
Come on in.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.050
Huuuuuh?!

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:10.020
Makopi?!

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:18.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.660
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.530
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.560
Every day it sparkles

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:29.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:36.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:41.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:47.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:52.890
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:58.600
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:07.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.140
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:11.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:21.050
is our promise between girls

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:27.090
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:33.000
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.010
The Transfer Student's

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.010
The Transfer Student's

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.610
Makopi's here, in the flesh!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:52.040
Didn't see that coming!

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.290
And get this, she sits next to <i>me</i>!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.460
I never thought you'd transfer here!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.260
But why the sudden move?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.850
If I want to find my queen,

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.600
I need to learn more about this world.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.290
But she really just wants to be around you all.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.600
Davi!

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.890
Oh, my heart!

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:17.300
I'm so happy you wanted to be with us!

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:21.480
Welcome to Oogai First Middle School.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:25.250
Does the student council know Makopi?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.240
How long were they looking?

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.360
Everyone's staring at us!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.440
Idols have it rough.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.700
She looked at us!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.760
She smiled!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.790
So cute!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.530
Well, she <i>is</i> an idol...

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:46.400
Not allowed go a whole day without smiling, huh?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.110
You're the only ones who can make her smile.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.580
I humbly ask that you take good care of Makoto.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:55.880
I'll be fine.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.880
I came to learn about this school of yours.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:03.650
Class, don't forget to write your names on the test!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.740
Names, huh?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.930
Test

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.930
Name

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.280
Makopi!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.130
Don't autograph it, just write it! Normally!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:15.550
Huh?

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:17.400
Like this?

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.100
Wait, Makopi!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:20.420
Huh?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.590
Hey, Makopi!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.940
Makopi's got a mop...

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.740
She's even cute while cleaning!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.130
It's like a mic! I hope she sings! {Sing Freebird!}

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.570
Makopi, stand back!

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.780
Cutest cleaning accident ever! {lit. "She's cute even while knocking buckets over!"}

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.800
That was cute?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.480
I'm sorry. I'll clean it right away.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.520
Huh?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.950
When I did this in the Trump Kingdom,

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.140
someone would be called to clean it up...

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.190
Well, I already did it, so don't worry.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.010
Good job, Rikka.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:07.640
Makopi might need some time to get used to school,

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.310
so let's stay with her.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.490
Sure.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.470
Makoto, excellent work!

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.050
Excellent work!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.730
Do you know them?

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.430
Those are Makoto's cheerleaders!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.910
They're all polite, upstanding people!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.290
I want an autograph!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.350
You bozos!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.720
This is Makoto's private life!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:36.810
No autographs!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.600
Right! Understood!

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.240
Now, we'll recite all 130 articles of our constitution!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.280
Number one!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.020
Protect Makopi's private life!

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.260
Protect Makopi's private life!

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.520
Number two!

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.420
They really are polite.

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.730
Never steal the spotlight! {this might be repeated, I forget}

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.730
Did they say 130?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:53.690
Number three!

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:55.700
Never betray your comrades!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.670
Hey, there's Makopi!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.760
She really did transfer here!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.630
Entertainment reporters.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.830
Look over here!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:03.840
Smile a bit!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.260
Go on without me.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:05.740
Huh?

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.840
I don't want to burden you two.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.660
What? But we were just about to go home together...

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.510
I'll get their attention.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.050
Rikka?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:17.520
You two can escape while I distract them.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.920
You've all clearly taken quite a few pictures,

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.840
but do you have the school's permission?

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:23.500
Well...

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.020
Having its students and uniforms photographed

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.310
is bad publicity for a school.

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:29.160
And above all,

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.900
when Kenzaki dons her uniform,

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.110
she is not an idol, but a student!

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.340
Now begone!

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:36.580
You heard the lady!

00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.850
Stay outta Makopi's private life!

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:39.740
Now's your chance!

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:41.790
Let's go, Makopi!

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:44.730
Hey, Makopi!

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.280
Hey, listen to me!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.190
We're fine here.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.460
Yes, thanks.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:55.660
But that was some quick thinking on Rikka's part!

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:58.360
Yeah, I always count on her!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.050
She sounds pretty reliable.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.330
Yeah, Rikka's reliable,

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.800
but she's more than that. She's my BFF!

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.030
Makopi?

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:11.440
Makoto's totally jealous!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.570
Davi!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.510
You're cute when you're honest!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.320
Yeah, it makes my heart throb!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.960
Good afternoon, Rikka.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.420
Alice.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:31.360
So, Makoto transferred into your school.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.880
You already knew?

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.770
Yes, but I worry.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:40.870
This is Makoto's first time attending school,

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.810
so she may get lost...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.020
<i>That's</i> what you're worried about?

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.800
But it's rather nice.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.480
Now we'll always be together.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:52.960
Yeah.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:56.960
Mana was happy about Makopi's transfer, too.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.890
Shall we visit Mana's home?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.880
Sure!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.040
I want to know what happened after they left.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.800
Oh, Rikka, Alice!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.690
Huh? Makopi?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.100
Good afternoon.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.950
Guess what? Makopi has a day off today!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.240
Now she can stay over here tonight!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.210
My, what fun.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.520
I know, right?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.750
You two should stay over, too!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.820
Well, my mom's coming home today...

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.080
What?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.290
I'll certainly do so next time.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.880
Aww...

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:41.120
I was hoping we'd get to eat dinner and do homework together like we always do.

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:46.700
But when we stay over, Rikka alway helps you with everything.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:51.920
The way I see it, Rikka babysits you more than anything!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.230
Sorry about that.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:55.220
Don't worry.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.010
So, next time, okay?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.310
Huh?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.140
Makopi's asleep.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.790
She was up late working, so she must have been tired.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:09.090
And she was still the center of attention at school.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.300
I'll let her sleep until dinner.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.240
Well, goodbye.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.440
Rikka, we simply must stay over next time.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:27.740
I'm certain Mana awaits it as well.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.150
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:37.500
Rikka looked kinda down today.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.490
Girls have moments like that.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.480
Moments like what?

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:46.400
Moments when their hearts ache.

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:49.100
It's quite complicated.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.070
Thanks for dinner.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.630
I'm so happy!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.240
About what, Mom?

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:00.190
I was just thinking about how blessed I am.

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.710
I can work as hard as I need to as a doctor,

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:08.540
and still come home to eat dinner and listen to my cute daughter.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.300
Life's perfect!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.720
So?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.890
How was your day, Rikka?

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:18.270
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.640
Well, I guess our class got a transfer student today...

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.890
and now she's staying over at Mana's house...

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.080
Quite the day.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:36.080
When you say nothing happened, I know something did.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.050
So you knew... {Level 3 yomi in here.}

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.240
Well, I <i>am</i> your mother.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.500
Rikka, you can't sleep?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:55.720
I keep wondering what Mana and Makopi are doing...

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.540
Knowing Mana,

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.740
they're probably up late chatting...

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.260
What is this feeling? {The feeling of being NTRed inside.}

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.040
Dangit!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.770
Stupid ball doesn't do what I tell it to! {Yes, he's personifying the ball out of rage, since he's not the type to own up to his own mistakes.}

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:39.280
Can't you just hit those stupid pins for once?!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.810
Must you always act like a child?

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.760
Huh?!

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:45.220
It's essential that he does.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.990
He wants everything to go his way.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.890
That's a fundamental emotion.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:53.200
Selfish as ever, I see.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.860
Guess that's why you'll always be a big baby.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.820
Cool bandages, pops. {Alt. "Cool bandages, Joakim."}

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:06.910
Five more...

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:13.870
Oh no!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:15.630
Mom, I've gotta go!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:16.720
Would you like breakfast?

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:17.880
Sorry, no time!

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.460
I've gotta see Mana!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.380
Oh, Mana called earlier.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:25.550
She said she already left with a girl named Makoto...

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.780
<i>Why?</i>

00:12:26.780 --> 00:12:28.430
<i>Did something happen?</i>

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:30.330
There they are!

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.500
Mana and Makopi!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:40.610
They came to see Ai.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.720
Makopi, feed her.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.330
You think I can?

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.880
Yeah, totally!

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:50.250
Here's your milky, Ai.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.360
Oh, good job!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.570
Look, Ai!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.220
It's your mommy, Mana, and your daddy, Makopi!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.550
You really are like a mommy and daddy!

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.090
Mommy and daddy?

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.300
They're like newlyweds.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:04.860
Alice!

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.030
Good morning.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:09.520
I was simply strolling by,

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:10.900
but they seem happy.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.140
Both Mana and Makoto.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.050
Yeah.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:16.680
Shall we join in?

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:17.940
Sure...

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.120
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.150
<i>What's this feeling?</i>

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:25.610
<i>My heart is aching...</i>

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.230
<i>I've felt strange since yesterday...</i>

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:29.530
I'm so jealous!

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:33.000
I'm <i>super</i> jealous!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.800
Who might that be?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.880
The head of Makopi's cheerleaders.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.790
Deep down,

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.590
I want to be that close to Makopi!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.060
No, I can't!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:48.220
This is Makopi's private life!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.240
This is what I swore to uphold!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.640
I-I apologize!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.200
Is he okay?

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.200
Maybe, but I'm worried.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.700
I can't!

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.610
It'd be impure for me alone to be close to her!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:10.940
Number one!

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:12.840
Protect Makopi's private life!

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:13.420
Number two!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.690
Never steal the spotlight!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.330
Number three!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.740
Never betray your comrades!

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:21.110
Aw, just get close to her.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:22.740
Who's there?

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.380
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:25.870
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:26.200
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:26.540
I'll turn your desire into a dream come true.

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:38.190
Go berserk!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.510
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:50.570
Seeeelfiiiish!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.540
L-O-V-E Lovely Makopi!

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.200
It's a Selfish!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.740
The cheerleader!

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.350
A dark heartbeat!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:01.540
It's over there!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.550
Makopi is mine!

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:09.370
I won't let anyone else have her!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.680
Is he red with jealousy?

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.340
I feel the same.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:19.880
I'm jealous of how well Mana and Makopi get along.

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:21.350
So jealous...

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.730
But that's only natural.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:30.910
You want to stay by a dear friend's side,

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.350
and be closer to her than anyone.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.840
Everyone feels that way.

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:37.580
Even I do. {Lamenting over her lack of relevance to the main cast outside of lodsofemone? How sad.}

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:39.750
Even you do,

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.710
and even the cheerleader does.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.190
Really?

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.820
It's true.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:52.720
But I cannot permit one to abuse those feelings to create a Selfish.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.300
Makopi is mine!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.270
I only have eyes for her!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:56.930
<i>I see...</i>

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.230
<i>So that's it.</i>

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.770
Let's go, Rachel!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.200
Rachel!

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:09.650
Precure Love Link!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:11.570
L-O-V-E!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.250
L-O-V-E!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.020
L-O-V-E!

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.040
L-O-V-E!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.440
The light of wisdom,

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.750
Cure Diamond!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.530
Stop!

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:54.910
I won't let you use that cheerleader any more!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.390
Rachel!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.400
Now, sparkle!

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.750
Twinkle Diamond!

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:11.590
I can't move!

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:14.080
Is your love that weak?

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:17.720
Melt the ice with the heat of your love!

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.420
L-O-V-E!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.390
I love Makopi!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:23.720
The ice!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.420
Makopi!

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.240
Alice!

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.080
Are you okay?

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.130
There's trouble! {Yeah, some help you're being here.}

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:30.330
It's the head of Makoto's cheerleaders!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.600
Love Makopi!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.230
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.690
Charles!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.770
Precure Love Link!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.570
L-O-V-E!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.140
L-O-V-E!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:44.960
L-O-V-E!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.170
L-O-V-E!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:19.950
Brimming with love,

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.180
Cure Heart!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.710
The warmth of the sun,

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.960
Cure Rosetta!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.670
The blade of courage,

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.870
Cure Sword!

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:40.620
Everyone!

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:44.000
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.330
Dokidoki Precure!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:50.810
Oh poor cheerleader who has lost his love,

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.980
I, Cure Heart,

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:56.240
will make your heart race once more! {Wow, Mana even stole the right to use the catchphrase this episode. What a cunt.}

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:58.570
I love Makopi!

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:01.440
I'm happy you feel that way,

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:06.190
but there's no joy in seeing you used like this!

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.820
Who are you?

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.880
You won't get between Makopi and I!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.740
L-E-T-S Let's Go Makopi!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.080
Davi!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.810
Glitter!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.710
Holy Sword!

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.120
Love!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.280
Lance!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:44.770
Rigid Rosetta Wall!

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.390
Rachel!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.340
Now, sparkle!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:01.010
Twinkle Diamond!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.300
Now's your chance, Cure Heart!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.190
I've got it!

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.290
Charles!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.800
From me to you,

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:23.100
My Sweet Heart!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:30.030
Love love looove!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.150
Huh?

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.630
Talk about head over heels!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:47.260
You and Heart really do work well together.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.380
I'm jealous of you two.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.490
I can feel how strongly you trust each other.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:56.640
As a latecomer,

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:59.900
I never knew if I could be as close as you are.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:03.940
But I want to be BFFs with you all! {Hard to split this into two, but oh well.}

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.640
Sword...

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:08.320
I feel the same way.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.860
I want to be better friends with you all.

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:12.820
A friend from the heart. {Whatever the fuck that means.}

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:14.110
Rosetta...

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.470
<i>We all feel the same way...</i>

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:22.670
<i>Everyone felt the same heartache!</i>

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.390
What're you talking about?

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.930
We're already friends, you know!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:32.190
But I know how you feel.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:35.060
Yeah!

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.240
Hey, wanna stay over this weekend?

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.010
A sleepover sounds wonderful!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:45.860
I approve!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.200
We could eat together and do homework! {You're the only one who does homework at a sleepover.}

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.310
Makoto's looking forward to it the most!

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:52.300
Davi!

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:56.860
I keep telling you to stop blurting out how I really feel before I can!

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:08.040
That's strange.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.810
There's a big game coming up,

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:11.210
but Mana isn't going!

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:12.510
She's the softball club's helper,

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:16.980
and given Mana's overwhelming sense of responsibility, it's unlike her to stand someone up!

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:18.720
Something has to have happened!

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:19.820
I'm sorry, everyone,

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:22.190
but there's something I have to do!

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:23.750
I'm coming to save you!

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.420
Just wait, Ai!

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:28.130
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.530
Awaken!

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.530
Awaken!

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:33.860
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
